{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1384-trinity-continuum-fan-resources","id":1384,"title":"Trinity Continuum Fan Resources","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-02T16:55:17-07:00","id":1384,"title":"Trinity Continuum Fan Resources","content":"I do this kind of thing for the Scion forums, but haven't seen anything like it for Trinity. In addition to the semi-official <i>Asia Ascendant</i>, there was also a fan-written Chitra Bhanu / India supplement written called <i>India Underground</i>. I think there might have been more... I vaguely recall, wait no, specifically recall a Field Report: Noetic Physics. I have been unable to find an existing PDF of that document, except on 4Shared which I hate using. Anyone got that handy?<br /> <br /> Anyway, here's links to the two books for people that are interested!<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://images4.wikia.nocookie.net/__cb20100924223033/whitewolf/images/2/2b/AsiaAscendant.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">Asia Ascendant + Order Book: Ministry</a><br /> <a href=\"http://heldaction.files.wordpress.com/2012/05/india_underground.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">India Underground + Order Book: Chitra Bhanu</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T17:20:40-07:00","id":1395,"title":"","content":"I have all of the Eon books, but I'm not sure if I'm allowed to post them. They seem to be fanbooks but I don't know if they're exclusive to site XYZ or what. Anyone know the deal with them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I had a signature but now I don't but it won't let me leave this blank so yeah.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/199-yue","name":"Yue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T17:29:26-07:00","id":1402,"title":"","content":"I think it should be alright as long as you aren't taking credit for their work. As a fan-book writer myself, I never have an issue with people reposting my material as long as they give me proper credit and (if possible) inform me about the reposting. I think some of the old EON writers are actually here on the forums... Ian might be one, actually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T17:51:00-07:00","id":1412,"title":"","content":"Oh wait, derp, the site's still up.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpgpost.com/files/category/3-aberrant/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpgpost.com/files/category/3-aberrant/\" target=\"_blank\"> 404 Not Found </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.rpgpost.com/files/category/3-aberrant/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.rpgpost.com/files/category/3-aberrant/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I had a signature but now I don't but it won't let me leave this blank so yeah.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/199-yue","name":"Yue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar199_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"61"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T18:07:23-07:00","id":1416,"title":"","content":"Minor note on Yue's link: it's to the Aberrant section. There's a menu on the right-hand side that lets you select Adventure or Trinity files.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm a professor! Why is no one listening to me?!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/235-telgar","name":"Telgar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar235_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2506"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T19:32:58-07:00","id":1445,"title":"","content":"As the guy behind what was EON, I can tell you that any books EON posted including InUn were available to be redistributed however you wanted, unless WW ever decided to say hey, knock that stuff off of course. Also, things ended up on RPG Post as noted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T08:35:22-08:00","id":1805,"title":"","content":"And you did a wonderful job on the Chitra Bhanu book. My players thank you and it will come up tonight as they are about to go up against an Aberrant in my on going Exploration series. Hopefully without losing half the group again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T10:12:41-08:00","id":1859,"title":"","content":"Thanks! To be fair, InUn was a half--and-half effort. I was heavily involved in getting it going and herding various art and writing (which took up crazy amounts of time). It ended up coming out just after I'd moved on, and handed the site over to others i think. IIRC its layout was put together partly on the back of stuff I'd already started, but it was 10 years ago or so, so the details are fuzzy. I think the new site team brought it to fruition after we'd got it something like 80% there, ish?. It was a two team effort, one I didn't complete myself - far from it!<br /> <br /> All in, its a decent book for a fan supplement<br /> <br /> I'm quite proud of the community that grew over at EON, but considered myself to have been largely a 'hands-off' curator of it all at the time, for example I never really got into the play-by-post stuff, although that was very popular and I initially resisted having a forum (ironically). Not being much of an Aberrant or A! fan I tended to stick to the Trinity content too - that and I was just being the guy who paid the bills and smacked the server up-side the head when it needed it.<br /> <br /> The EON regulars are who made the site what it was <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":232,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","user":"CHILL","date":". 11-03-2013, 01:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T02:39:04-08:00","id":14616,"title":"","content":"The India Underground was a fantastic supplement, when I ran across it years ago I could hardly believe it was free. The campaign I was trying to start at the time was not getting traction until I read the book and it gave me some new ideas which I used in a restart which did take hold. I used a lot of equipment and situations from it, and it got to be a running joke that about the only aircraft that would be issued to one of the PCs (who was a wild and somewhat careless pilot) was an old battered Gila because the thing was so tough as well as long ago paid for. Another plot thread was that it took a while but eventually the PCs figured out that one of their team was Chib masquerading as a low powered electrokinetic but by that time they were too close to her to want to turn her in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/869-bc001","name":"BC001","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar869_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T19:10:29-08:00","id":15791,"title":"","content":"BC001, nice! Great to see it was/is appreciated, it was a LOT of work! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#ff0000\"><b>Ad Astra</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/232-chill","name":"CHILL","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar232_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}